1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,630
A coin flip steered 50 experts.

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,210
Not one of them knew.

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,700
Each had an AI helper, like yours.

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,670
And a coin secretly picked its favorite answers.

5
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,880
Picture a scale.

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,250
Both options are fair...

7
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,820
and the AI drops a coin on one side.

8
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,600
The experts went with the coin's side 86% of the time.

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,550
By chance?

10
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,560
About half.

11
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,710
Some had already decided.

12
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:24,160
When the AI disagreed...

13
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,640
they switched, more than half the time.

14
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,920
Here's the weird part.

15
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,020
Most repeated the AI's arguments...

16
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,710
but only about 1 in 7 gave it credit.

17
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,610
The catch?

18
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:38,320
Anthropic tested its own AI, and made the coin extra heavy on purpose.

19
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:40,320
Everyday AI may push less.

20
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,450
So ask your AI one more thing.

21
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,660
"What's the best case for the other side?"

22
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,560
Now there's a coin on both sides.

23
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:47,890
The choice is yours.

24
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,790
There's one word in this video I never said out loud.

25
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:51,560
Spotted it?

26
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,340
Comment it.

27
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,910
Follow for more AI, explained like this.

28
00:00:54,910 --> 00:00:56,040
Think you'd notice?

29
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,200
Because...
